clearing-tape posting record
-----------------------------
record length : 8 bytes, fixed
records       : file length / 8, in file order

field    offset  width  meaning
ledger   0       2      ledger key
amount   2       6      posting amount, in minor units

The accessor words for these fields are defined in recfmt.fs. Read every field
of every frame through those words so the tape is interpreted the one way the
kit intends.
